# The built binary. `go build` puts it in the module root by default.
/reasonix-selfhost
/reasonix-selfhost.exe

# The service's own state: the SQLite file holds the account, the devices and
# every ticket, so it is the one thing here that must never leave the machine
# it runs on. The default DATA dir is ./data.
/data/

# Deployment secrets: the admin token and the two public origins live here.
# A copy belongs on the server, never in the repository.
*.env
.env*
!.env.example

# Editor and OS noise.
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/